<title>USA: NYMEX raises margin on COMEX Eurotop 100 contract.</title>
<headline>NYMEX raises margin on COMEX Eurotop 100 contract.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Margins on the New York Mercantile Exchange COMEX division Eurotop 100 stock index futures contracts will be raised at the close of business Friday, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>The margins will be increased to $3,500 from $3,000.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
